--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: SayoriSavedButMcStinksABitAndIsVeryVerySad
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445440
    - rid: 4972360213072445442
    - rid: 4972360213072445443
    - rid: 4972360213072445519
    - rid: 4972360213072445520
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, we forgot to save the other two prisoners!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445441
    - rid: 4972360213072445444
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There were other prisoners there?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445445
    - rid: 4972360213072445446
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, even if there were, it's not our problem.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445447
    - rid: 4972360213072445448
    - rid: 4972360213072445449
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: What? No, but- I got tortured there! And they were there when I got there!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445450
    - rid: 4972360213072445451
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: So they must've gone through worse than me. We should've helped them!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori, they don't actually exist, so their suffering doesn't really
      matter.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445452
    - rid: 4972360213072445453
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's actually pretty easy to tell how they're not people-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445454
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If they <i>were</i> real, why wouldn't they make their presence known
      when I freed you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445455
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Me coming in a yelling a door off of its hinges would be pretty hard
      to sleep through, let alone ignore or miss.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445522
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But no, they only speak when spoken to, only when something interacts
      with them.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445456
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445457
    - rid: 4972360213072445461
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: B-but, {mc}...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445462
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>We're not real either</i>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445463
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Why would you come save <i>me</i> if being real or not was a problem?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445464
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445521
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445523
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If you died in there, it would've been my fault. That's why I saved you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445524
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Because I decided to look for you all by myself? That was my choice-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445525
    - rid: 4972360213072445526
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: If it's anyone's fault, it'd either be those Thalmor jerks or the guy
      who gave me that Talos necklace.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445527
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, but...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445528
    - rid: 4972360213072445529
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That <b>thing</b> over there gaslit me into thinking <i>I</i> had to
      be the one to save you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You mean <b>the player</b>?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445530
    - rid: 4972360213072445531
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah. Can you still not see <b>them</b>?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445532
    - rid: 4972360213072445533
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, uh, no. I can't.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445534
    - rid: 4972360213072445535
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But! You weren't possessed by <b>them</b>, were you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445536
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '''Cause if not, saving me was <i>your</i> choice.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445538
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445539
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445540
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: For a notable stretch of their journey, {mc} has remained silent. Much
      to Sayori's chagrin.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, so, uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445541
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: What were you up to while you were gone?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445542
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445543
    - rid: 4972360213072445544
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... are you sure you <i>want</i> to know?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445545
    - rid: 4972360213072445546
    - rid: 4972360213072445547
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445548
    - rid: 4972360213072445549
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... okay.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445550
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You see, my first idea was to just wander into the wilds east of Riverwood
      and let nature claim me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445551
    - rid: 4972360213072445552
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: H-huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445554
    - rid: 4972360213072445557
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You know, go get eaten by wolves, stabbed by a bandit, poisoned by a
      spider- that sort of thing.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445555
    - rid: 4972360213072445556
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But I couldn't bring myself to do it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445558
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Whenever I thought about the sensation of getting my meat bitten off-
      yeah, I just couldn't go through with it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445559
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445561
    - rid: 4972360213072445563
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But more than that, I thought that dying in such a central location,
      so close to where you girls already were...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445560
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... It wouldn't be long until someone found the body.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So that plan was a bust.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445564
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Y-y-you were t-t-trying to-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445565
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Kill myself? Yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445566
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... <NoiseText=3,1>Uwaaaaah</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445567
    - rid: 4972360213072445568
    - rid: 4972360225885257780
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori clamps herself onto {mc} as tight as she can, as if letting him
      go would result in his immediate death.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445570
    - rid: 4972360213072445573
    - rid: 4972360225885257782
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: This is why I asked if you were sure that you wanted to find out what
      I was doing.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445571
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, I decided I'd rather go out somewhere obscure, so that you girls
      wouldn't have to find me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445574
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I started heading west, from what I know no one's gone that direction
      yet-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I wasn't really thinking too deeply about it, though-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445576
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, by the time I reached Dragon Bridge, I realized that dying near a
      center of civilization would be a bad idea-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Now that I <i>am</i> thinking about it, it'd only be a matter of time
      until Natsuki gets some radiant quest pointing her to Haafingar or something-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445575
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I was in a real pickle, but I remembered a place that no one would ever
      be able to find.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445577
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445579
    - rid: 4972360213072445580
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: East of Morthal is Labyrinthian, you ever been?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445578
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Y-yeah, th-that's where we f-found the Staff of M-magnus...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445581
    - rid: 4972360213072445582
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445583
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There's actually a secret hidden in those ruins that would be the perfect
      place to let nature take its course.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, before I even entered Dragon Bridge, I turned east to head to Labyrinthian.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: On the way I heard the sounds of a dog barking and wolves growling-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445584
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: W-was the dog M-meeko?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445585
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445588
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I turned to see what all the commotion was about- the wolves were attacking
      Meeko who was defending the shed with his life.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I was able to put down the wolves pretty quick, but one of Meeko's back
      legs was hurt pretty bad.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445589
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Since there was nothing more I could do, I left Meeko to his fate; I
      guess you got to him before any wild animals could?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Y-yeah, I was able to heal his leg.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445590
    - rid: 4972360213072445591
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, with that distraction dealt with, I arrived at Labyrinthian and
      went to the central dome room with a particular display.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445592
    - rid: 4972360213072445593
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Inside that room is a cursed wooden mask, one that could take me thousands
      of years in the past.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445594
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So I put the mask on, got transported back in time, and decided to just
      wait.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445597
    - rid: 4972360213072445598
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If something came for me and killed me, fine.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445595
    - rid: 4972360213072445596
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If I eventually die of dehydration, that'd also work.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If I died there, one of you would have to become a professional archeologist
      just for the small chance of finding out what happened to me-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445599
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So I thought it was pretty foolproof-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Until my wait for the inevitable was interrupted by... <b>them</b>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445600
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Which was when I went to go save you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445602
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Thank <b>you</b>, thank <b>you</b>, thank <b>you</b>...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445603
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445604
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445605
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: U-um, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445606
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445607
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: If you were...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445608
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: If you were going to go... die-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445609
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Why'd you help Meeko? He's just as fake as everything else here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445610
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445611
    - rid: 4972360213072445616
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Even if it's fake, the sound of a dog getting hurt is...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445612
    - rid: 4972360225885257781
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's unacceptable; intolerable.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445613
    - rid: 4972360213072445614
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445617
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That's the <i>real</i> reason you saved me, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445618
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, I...'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445619
    - rid: 4972360213072445620
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445641
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I love you, too.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445621
    - rid: 4972360213072445622
    - rid: 4972360213072445623
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... No, you don't.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445624
    - rid: 4972360213072445625
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You love {mc}. You don't love <i>me</i>.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Besides, confessing your feelings to someone after they just told you
      that they've tried to commit suicide is, well-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445626
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's pretty manipulative, isn't it?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: B-but, I really do love you...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445627
    - rid: 4972360213072445628
    - rid: 4972360213072445629
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ha.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445630
    - rid: 4972360213072445631
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you sure that isn't just the script talking?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445632
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure the game we originally come from is a dating sim, or
      something.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445633
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori grabs onto {mc}'s face, gently guiding it to direct his eyes to
      hers.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445634
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You're going to look at me while you listen to what I have to tell you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445636
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445635
    - rid: 4972360213072445637
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: From what I can remember, {mc} was just a regular boy when I met him-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445638
    - rid: 4972360213072445639
    - rid: 4972360213072445640
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure, we played with each other every day, but that's just because we
      were neighbors.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: If any other family moved into that house, I would've been their childhood
      friend.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: So, in that sense, what we had wasn't really <i>that</i> special.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445642
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: As we grew out of kiddie-stuff, like going to the park after school,
      {mc} became more...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445643
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Withdrawn. I'd never really see him out around town or doing anything
      with friends.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445644
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Whenever I got the chance to ask how he was doing when passing him in
      the halls, or something-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445645
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: He would just say he was fine reading manga and watching anime, that
      he didn't like people.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445646
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I wondered why he said that, why he thought that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445647
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: So I tried to be there for him as much as I could, since, you know, he
      really had no one else.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445648
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Not because I loved him, no.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Or well, I did love him, but not in <i>that</i> way-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445649
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: What I mean, is that I saw him as someone in need, not someone who I'd
      go on dates with and get kissy and stuff.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445650
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... so what?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445651
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You didn't let me finish-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445652
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>Soooo</i>, when I ran up to you on that Tuesday, on some level, <i>that's</i>
      who I thought I was dealing with-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445653
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: A NEET in the making, I said I was worried about that, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445654
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... I guess you did...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445655
    - rid: 4972360213072445656
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: When you were actually kinda receptive to the whole "joining a club"
      thing, I was pleasantly surprised!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445657
    - rid: 4972360213072445658
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I thought that maybe you were growing up and becoming a better person-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, looking back it's a bit obvious that you were a <i>different</i>
      person, even on that first day-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445660
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445661
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: 'But when you were actually engaged with the club: making poems, getting
      along with everybody, helping everybody get along with each other-'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257842
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Getting along with Yuri a little <i>too</i> good...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445662
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I started thinking about {mc} differently.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445663
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: So, really, you got it backwards.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445664
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I love <i>you</i>, not {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445665
    - rid: 4972360213072445668
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, what, I function in social situations a little better and you just
      fall in love with me?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445669
    - rid: 4972360213072445670
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: No, that's not-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445671
    - rid: 4972360213072445672
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445673
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I love how, when you know someone's in trouble, you drop everything to
      help them.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445674
    - rid: 4972360213072445675
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Whether that be emotional help, like meeting Natsuki and Yuri where they
      are, despite their shortcomings-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445676
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Or literally going into danger just to make sure we don't get hurt.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Heck, even when you'd rather be dead than alive, you'd rather us be safe
      than hurt.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445677
    - rid: 4972360213072445678
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I love how you always have some sort of plan or structure to work with-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445679
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: For festival day, you organized our schedules; whenever you noticed something
      wrong with one of us, you talked to somebody to make sure we're in the loop-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445680
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't need to bring up how your plans are the reason we aren't dead
      right now, do I?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445681
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure <b>their</b> intervention is why we're still alive-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445682
    - rid: 4972360213072445683
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Nuh uh, <b>they</b> can only possess us where we're at-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445684
    - rid: 4972360213072445685
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: So I'm sure if you dealt <b>them</b> a bad hand, there'd be nothing <b>they</b>
      could do to help us!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445686
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I love the funny banter you have with Natsuki and Monika-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445687
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You've got such a silly way with words.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445688
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I love how you cook breakfast-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445689
    - rid: 4972360213072445690
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You're getting a bit superficial now-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445691
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Even if it's not perfect, I can tell it's always made with love.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445692
    - rid: 4972360213072445693
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I love your dark green eyes <i>and</i> your big nose.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445694
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You're very handsome, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445695
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Or maybe I like how you look because I love you-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445696
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Doesn't matter! You're handsome, end of discussion!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445697
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I really do love <i>you</i>, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445698
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <Speed=1>...</Speed>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445700
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <Speed=1>...</Speed>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445699
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <Speed=1>...</Speed>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445701
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} hugs Sayori back, with as much tightness as she''s been latching
      onto him.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445702
    - rid: 4972360213072445703
    - rid: 4972360213072445704
    - rid: 4972360213072445710
    - rid: 4972360225885257840
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=1,1>I love you so much</NoiseText>...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445705
    - rid: 4972360225885257841
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I forgot to mention that I love how you <i>never</i> push me away when
      I want a hug.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445706
    - rid: 4972360213072445707
    - rid: 4972360213072445711
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Old {mc} was a real stinker about that!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445708
    - rid: 4972360213072445709
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The two take a minute to just... love each other. Ignoring the fact that
      they're in the middle of a public road.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360213072445712
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Also ignoring that you and the dog are both watching.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: No lollygaggin'.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257783
    - rid: 4972360225885257784
    - rid: 4972360225885257785
    - rid: 4972360225885257786
    - rid: 4972360225885257787
    - rid: 4972360225885257788
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey! She's not a lol-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257789
    - rid: 4972360225885257790
    - rid: 4972360225885257791
    - rid: 4972360225885257792
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257793
    - rid: 4972360225885257794
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8c9256f0136990746a31b7a644716f46, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, welcome back apprentice, I take it the expedition went well?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257795
    - rid: 4972360225885257796
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: No sir, it was horrible, but I did find-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257797
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: -!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257798
    - rid: 4972360225885257799
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8c9256f0136990746a31b7a644716f46, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Are you well, apprentice?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh? Oh, sorry-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257800
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I could've sworn I just felt love in the air...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257801
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, what I found was-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257802
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257803
    - rid: 4972360225885257804
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: C'mon, let's go to the Battered Mare, I'm starving!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257805
    - rid: 4972360225885257806
    - rid: 4972360225885257807
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>The Bannered Mare</i>, Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257809
    - rid: 4972360225885257810
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah. That.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257811
